visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Herbs & Spices","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Candy Stores","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Souvenir Shops","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Shopping","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"DTDz_tXLGNWHZjmM6SvcEA","review_id":"mdQ8BaOttQmKl-yASSaYpg","date":"2016-05-31T02:57:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9393017888069153,"text_excerpt":"This is one of the nicest souvenir shops in the French Quarter. To begin with it's huge and has a nice layout. I immediately noticed how new everything appeared. I'm not sure if it is a newly remodeled space or not but there is a significant difference between this shop and many others which I happened to really like. The pralines display in the window is what caught my eye. Aside from boxed varieties, they also have a set-up for making them fresh in the store too. This place has a HUGE selection of hot sauces! They are all relatively inexpensive and many are available for customers to sample. But beware. There are some extremely hot ones for sale. I even saw an employee require a lady to..."},{"business_id":"DTDz_tXLGNWHZjmM6SvcEA","review_id":"QZHVzXoI6lHeUXpzYwLqGA","date":"2018-04-04T00:43:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9371094703674316,"text_excerpt":"It's a tourist trap but that is okay! Some of the best praline I've ever had and they do free samples. They also have hot sauce you literally need to sign a waiver to try. Not for me but if that's your jam worth hitting this place up. I liked a lot of their spice collections as well. Fun set up and the ladies at the counter are super helpful."},{"business_id":"DTDz_tXLGNWHZjmM6SvcEA","review_id":"xhQ8FK15PA_p6s5hDBPmKg","date":"2017-04-25T12:49:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.934402346611023,"text_excerpt":"I found myself here doing a mix of tourist shopping for my friends and of course for myself. The big sign that read, \"Magnolia Sugar & Spice\" pulled me in as well as the big opening in the store. It's got this charm (and smell of pralines) that kind of pulls you in. The store has tons of gift ideas. Something for everyone you feel like buying for, from coffee, coffee mugs and pralines to hot sauces, cookbooks and more. You can sample the pralines before you even buy them which is nice and they come in individually wrapped cookies or boxes. In the middle of the store you can sample the different hot sauces and such. Not necessarily my thing because I start thinking about the germs, but hav..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"DTDz_tXLGNWHZjmM6SvcEA","photo_id":"nsraW4o1nW-nQq5N2wUCbg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/nsraW4o1nW-